# Outframe brand

- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind.
- UI: dark pine/teal (`pine-*`), lime accent (`#c8f542`). Fonts: Syne + Outfit, Manrope for Cyrillic.
- Do not use purple, cream, beige, or generic AI-landing palettes.
- App chrome stays dark. The proposal sheet is cool paper (`#f3f6f3`) so Print/PDF stays readable.
- Copy is Russian, short, and concrete. No “AI magic” filler.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="bg-purple-950 text-amber-50">Generate with AI</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="bg-pine-900 text-paper">
  <span className="text-lime">Собрать КП</span>
</div>
```
